    "turn_text": "My final two, right after this. With offices in tech hubs throughout the country, including San Francisco, Boston, and Atlanta, and new offices in Seattle, Denver, and Chicago, Ridgebank continues to meet the innovation ecosystem wherever it thrives. And through its teams focused on technology and life sciences companies and the equity investors who fuel them, Ridgebank delivers a responsive, high-touch client experience. Ridgebank is a division of Western Alliance Bank. Ridgebank. Be bold, venture wisely.",
